        "original_id": "300f618c-5a70-51f9-b0fc-e4ab403ea3e6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Münch, Alfred Jodl\n- Roles: actor, general, war criminal, Chief of the Operations Staff\n- Works: Patton\n- Organizations: Armed Forces High Command, Oberkommando der Wehrmacht\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Alfred Jodl was born on 10 May 1890 and died on 16 October 1946.\n- Alfred Jodl was a German general and war criminal during World War II.\n- Alfred Jodl served as Chief of the Operations Staff of the Armed Forces High Command, also called the Oberkommando der Wehrmacht.\n- Richard Münch was born on 10 January 1916 and died on 6 June 1987.\n- Richard Münch was a German actor.\n- In 1970, Richard Münch portrayed Alfred Jodl in the film \"Patton,\" and this role is what he was best known for.",
